SUMMARY:John Rock the long way
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nJohn Rock the Long Way\nDistance: 
 7.5-8 miles\nElevation: 1\,500’\nSpeed: 2-2.5 mph average\n\nWe’ll mee
 t at the Pisgah Ranger station at 8:45 for a 9AM sharp start. Due to limit
 ed parking at the fish hatchery it would be better to meet at the ranger s
 tation for call pooling.\n\nWe’ll start on Cat Gap Loop for .4 miles and
  then turn onto Butter Gap. Follow Butter Gap until the Pickelmiser connec
 tor\, head down the connector back to Cat Gap. Follow Cat Gap to the Cat G
 ap connector over to the John Rock trail. Head up John Rock\, stop at the 
 view point and then the back to Cat Gap and the parking lot.\n\nDogs are w
 elcome. I will have my dog with me.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314899919
 /
