SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #9 - Downtown to Windswept from First Baptist Church
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Meeting Place:** Park in the Fir
 st Baptist Church parking lot between the church and the YMCA.\n**Meeting 
 Point:** [https://maps.app.goo.gl/zYYZFLSk7rg4pdrP6](https://maps.app.goo.
 gl/zYYZFLSk7rg4pdrP6)\n**Rating:** Strenuous for Pace and Distance\n**Surf
 ace:** Road and some trail\n**Mileage:** about 5.5 miles\n**Elevation Gain
 :** 750\n**Sun Exposure: This is a mostly urban hike\, about 30% shade.**\
 n**Pace:** 3.0 mph flats\, slower on steep climbs. We will stop at the top
  of Windswept for a short break\, and we will finish within 2 hours. We wa
 lk at a pretty fast pace\, so please be aware of your capabilities.\n**Fea
 tures:** Downtown points of interest\, views from Windswept. Bears rarely 
 seen.\n**After Eats:** Taco Temple\n**Dogs: Well behaved dogs are welcome.
  Bring water - it's gets hot on the climb!**\n\n**Scenic Asheville Series:
 ** There are 10 hikes in the [series](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1
 1ewlUM9OV8I4npc1cNNsSYOnXI0QPw2isAleXdFzEbI/edit?usp=drivesdk)\; hike 9 of
  them and receive an attractive [badge](https://docs.google.com/drawings/d
 /1goXUXfzUBqhB4_UeCxodlk4ZPeCCgqZrWK2EUJvk_vI/edit) for your backpack. Che
 ck your progress [HERE](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_Ohx
 KIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB_NEjjI5Lk/edit?usp=sharing). Check out our highlig
 hts [here](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/18cFp2Uhw8XthOFXxekBpt2L
 GP6ww-V7kmXQExI7Y0h0/edit?usp=drivesdk).\n\n**General Route:** [Avl Urban 
 Trail to Windswept](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/evening-hike-at-
 avl-urban-trail-to-windswept-7949e45)\nHere is the full list of waypoints\
 , but we will not stop for all of them: [Downtown to Windswept Waypoints](
 https://docs.google.com/document/d/1h6VbzxQjBE8Ha6X8kfX9Hhtvn9LE-Q5BgD_Uz1
 2SE-c/edit?usp=sharing)\n\nRSVP and On-Time Start:\n\n*If you decide you c
 annot come\, please change your RSVP\, so that Wait-listers can move up.\n
 - There are generally 1 or 2 no-shows on my hikes\, so we don't wait for p
 eople to arrive. If you are late\, you'll be left behind.\n*Notes and comm
 ents are genuinely appreciated.\n\n**Guests**: Please make sure your guest
 s know the distance\, pace and elevation gain.\n\n**Disclaimer and Release
  of Liability:**\nThis activity involves hiking on city streets that may h
 ave traffic. Participants are responsible for their safety on streets and 
 trails. The organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional g
 uide. The function of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you 
 sign up or participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and v
 oluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages
  arising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In additi
 on\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meet
 up.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
